    "backstory": "Once a promising skateboarder before the Great Liquidity Drought, 'Bonez' witnessed his flock dwindle as DRIP dried up and territorial disputes turned violent. Now, fueled by toxic fumes and the ghost of punk rock, he scavenges the ruins of Subchain City, seeking vengeance for his fallen comrades.",
